@baseUrl = http://localhost:5117

### Ask a question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What should I check before returning headphones?" }

### Extract a structured ticket (validated, retried with feedback)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "My order A-12345 still hasn't arrived after two weeks and I need it for a trip on Friday." }

### Health (never calls the model)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
